      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i looked at the logs and the bandwidth usage seems fine, so it doesn't look like simple congestion. i'm also seeing some weird interface errors on edge-rt-lyon-02. it's intermittent, like nothing is staying constant. could it be a physical layer issue? maybe a bad cable or interference? or is there something else that causes that kind of erratic behavior?",
